#og-profile:yarn-spinner-3.2.2
#og-name:smith
#og-local:mood
title: greet
og-speaker: smith|npc.smith|art/smith.png|right
---
<<declare $mood = 0>>
<<declare $gold = 10>>
<<declare $charm = 3>>
smith: Steel's not cheap. You've {$gold} gold. #line:smith.hello
<<set $mood = $mood + 1>>
-> Buy the sword (10 gold) <<if $gold >= 10>> #line:smith.buy #kind:trade #reason:smith.need_gold #reason-arg:need=10-$gold
    <<set $gold = $gold - 10>>
    <<jump bought>>
-> Haggle #line:smith.haggle #check:active:charm:12 #fail:angry
    <<jump bought>>
-> Ask about the old forge #line:smith.secret #check:passive:charm:5 #hide
    <<jump bought>>
-> Leave #line:smith.leave #timer:30
    <<stop>>
===
title: bought
---
smith: Mind the edge. #line:smith.thanks
<<quest progress rescue sword>>
<<give_sword {$mood}>>
===
title: angry
---
=> smith: Fine. Again, then. #line:smith.calm #weight:1
    <<jump greet>>
=> smith: Out of my forge! #line:smith.furious #weight:3
===
